page('news/upcoming-changes-to-our-payment-options/index.html','Upcoming Changes to Our Payment Options','An update from Three AM on future payment options.',hero(['<a href="../../index.html">Home</a>','<a href="../index.html">News</a>','<span aria-current="page">Payment options</span>'],'News','Upcoming Changes to Our Payment Options','An update regarding a shift in how Three AM handles invoices.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="shell article-layout"><article class="article-copy"><p>We want to share a quick update regarding a shift in how we handle invoices at Three AM.</p><p>The Reserve Bank of Australia is introducing a total ban on credit card surcharges starting 1 October. To adapt to these new regulations without changing our core service pricing, we will be removing credit card payments as an option sometime before the October deadline.</p><p>Moving forward, direct bank transfer will be our only available payment method. For now, your current payment options remain exactly the same.</p><p>Thank you for your continued support and understanding as we make this adjustment.</p></article><aside class="article-meta"><span>Published</span><strong>2 July 2026</strong><span>Category</span><strong>Three AM news</strong><a href="../index.html">All news ↗</a></aside></div></section>''',prefix='../../')
